sequenceDiagram
    participant LabAdmin as Lab admin
    participant Accountant
    participant Web as Web app
    participant API
    participant Engine as WorkflowEngineService
    participant Fin as LabFinanceListeners
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    LabAdmin->>Web: Accept item in the lab portal
    Web->>API: item transition "accept"
    API->>Engine: transition on the item's pinned version
    Engine->>DB: item state becomes accepted
    Engine->>Engine: item listener runs BillDraftsService.sync
    Engine->>DB: create or update draft vendor bill VB-n at frozen lab cost
    Note over Engine,DB: one transaction, all or nothing
    Accountant->>Web: Bill lab work, Issue now
    Web->>API: POST /lab-billing/invoices with issue true
    API->>DB: draft invoice, lines at frozen patient price
    API->>DB: number LINV-n, due date, status issued
    API->>Fin: invoiceIssued event
    Fin->>DB: commission snapshot on lines, receivable journal
    API->>DB: apply patient advance if any
    Accountant->>Web: Collect payment
    Web->>API: POST /lab-billing/payments with Idempotency-Key
    API->>DB: receipt LRC-n, payment, allocations, totals
    API->>Fin: paymentCollected event
    Fin->>DB: cash journal, commission entries, commission journal
    API->>DB: payment.receipt outbox row for the patient
    API-->>Web: 201 Payment received
